<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cullinan Holdings yr shr dives into loss.</title>
<headline>Cullinan Holdings yr shr dives into loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended 30 June 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts) loss  17.4	vs    285.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		     -	 vs     -</p>
<p>    Net attributable loss   2.60	vs    19.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss		1.04	vs    17.35</p>
<p>    Tax			   0.36	vs     0.34</p>
<p>    Turnover		  342.35	vs   345.53</p>
<p>Full name: Cullinan Holdings Limited (technology)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it was examining a further restructuring to reduce borrowings radically. This cold either be a new equity injection or merger, or the sale of operations, or a combination of both. Initiatives had started, progress had been made and a course of action would be formulated shortly, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
